Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:14.00,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}NimCFA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:14.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}NIM ⇄ FCFA on MTN MoMo and Orange Money,\Nright inside Nimiq Pay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:14.00,Body,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}Cash out NIM to mobile money in FCFA, or top up NIM by paying with mobile money. A few taps, in French or English, for Cameroon and the CEMAC zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.00,0:00:14.00,Small,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}Nimiq Mini Apps Competition · Cycle III · On/Off-Ramp track · by Mbanya Dev
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:23.48,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Demo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:23.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}The live mini app from GitHub Pages, on Nimiq testnet. Outside Nimiq Pay it uses a testnet preview wallet; inside Nimiq Pay the same calls go through the mini app SDK.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:32.72,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Cash out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:32.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Enter the FCFA you want to receive and a mobile money number. MTN MoMo or Orange Money is detected from the prefix, and the rate is locked for 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:47.91,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Cash out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.82,0:00:47.91,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}One approval sends NIM to the escrow address with the order memo. The server checks sender, memo, amount and network on-chain, then pays out to mobile money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:54.44,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}1 · Paid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:54.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}2,000 FCFA sent to MTN MoMo. Every step links to the transaction on the Nimiq testnet explorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:01:13.33,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}2 · Automatic refund
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:01:13.33,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}What if the operator rejects the payout? The simulator fails numbers ending in 1 so we can show it: the NIM goes straight back to the sender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:19.89,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}2 · Refunded
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.43,0:01:19.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Refunded on-chain. An unknown payout result is held for manual review instead of retried, so nobody is ever paid twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:33.75,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}3 · Top up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.99,0:01:33.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Pay FCFA with a USSD push on your phone. Once the operator confirms, the server sends NIM to your Nimiq Pay address.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:40.32,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}3 · NIM delivered
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.85,0:01:40.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Mobile money in, NIM out, in seconds on testnet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:45.35,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}History
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.42,0:01:45.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Every order, its status and its on-chain links, so users have a reason to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:56.36,CapHead,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}Bilingual
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.45,0:01:56.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,200)}French and English. The app follows the Nimiq Pay host language and network.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:01:56.36,Tag,,0,0,0,,TESTNET · MOBILE MONEY SIMULATED · NO REAL FRANCS MOVE
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.66,0:02:16.36,H2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}How it works
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.16,0:02:16.36,List,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,300)}• App: Vite + React + @nimiq/mini-app-sdk: accounts, balance, send with memo, host language and network\N• Server: Node + Hono order engine, Nimiq JSON-RPC, @nimiq/core signing\N• Price: CoinGecko NIM/EUR × 655.957 (fixed FCFA/EUR peg), 10-minute quotes\N• Mobile money: pluggable simulator, Fapshi or CamPay sandbox\N• Safety: deposit only from the order's wallet with its memo, automatic refunds, one payout attempt per order, masked phone numbers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:31.36,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}NimCFA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}mbanyadev.github.io/nimcfa\Ngithub.com/mbanyadev/nimcfa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.36,0:02:31.36,Body,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,400)}Next: a real mobile money sandbox, testers in Cameroon, USDT cash-out and a local agent network.
